WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.964 --> 00:00:09.134
What… is this?

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:13.138
This is what is necessary

00:00:13.221 --> 00:00:16.307
for Cybertron's survival.

00:00:16.391 --> 00:00:17.475
[Shamble] No!

00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:18.852
I am loyal!

00:00:18.935 --> 00:00:20.270
I'm a loyal Decepticon!

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:21.771
-[Barricade grunts]
-[groans]

00:00:23.356 --> 00:00:24.482
[gasps]

00:00:25.066 --> 00:00:26.276
Do it.

00:00:26.359 --> 00:00:28.903
[console trilling]

00:00:28.987 --> 00:00:32.407
[electricity crackling]

00:00:42.751 --> 00:00:47.630
[Decepticons yelling, groaning]

00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:05.190
How…

00:01:05.273 --> 00:01:06.941
How can you do this?

00:01:07.025 --> 00:01:10.028
[growls] I'm not the one doing this!

00:01:10.111 --> 00:01:13.031
This is the horror forced upon me

00:01:13.114 --> 00:01:15.241
by your noble leader!

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:19.662
This is the reality
Prime left for all of us!

00:01:19.704 --> 00:01:23.792
Murdering your own kind… for energon?

00:01:23.875 --> 00:01:29.214
[snarling] Your concern
for my people is needless.

00:01:29.339 --> 00:01:32.717
The next harvest will be powered

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:36.471
by four Autobot sparks.

00:01:37.222 --> 00:01:41.392
-Take them away.
-Yes, Lord Megatron.

